# User data (SENSITIVE - NEVER PUSH)
# Structured data (users/pets/devices/events) now lives in Postgres, not
# here — data/ only holds each user's uploaded pet photos. The root-level
# users.json/database.json/feeding_log.json are pre-migration leftovers
# (users.json still has real password hashes) — keep them ignored until
# they're deleted.
data/
*.log
users.json
database.json
feeding_log.json

